<title>USA: Goody's May same-store sales rise 8.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Goody's May same-store sales rise 8.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$67.5	$58.5     +15.4	 +8.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $257.6     $209.3     +23.1	+13.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	  May 31.</p>
<p>Full company name is Goody's Family Clothing Inc.</p>
